-------------------
GIBBS FREE ENERGY
-------------------

The Gibbs free energy is G = H - T*S

Total enthalpy                    ...   -987.43780300 Eh 
Total entropy correction          ...     -0.04946630 Eh    -31.04 kcal/mol
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Final Gibbs free energy         ...   -987.48726930 Eh

For completeness - the Gibbs free energy minus the electronic energy
G-E(el)                           ...      0.07798796 Eh     48.94 kcal/mol



